<p>1. The one-time charge reflects a management bonus (primarily paid in company stock) and the discontinuation of a prior management incentive plan.  The management bonus plan is comprised of 1,100,000 shares of common stock and a cash portion to satisfy the recipients' tax obligations arising from the management bonus.</p>
