<p>3. This information excludes the effect of the one-time charge described in footnote one, above, and reflects (i) the interest savings resulting from the initial public offering and the company's amended bank agreement for the period prior to 5/13/97;(ii) the implementation of tax saving strategies the company  expects to realize in the fourth quarter of 1997, as if they had been implemented at Jan. 1, 1997; and (iii) shares outstanding, in thousands, of 48,438 for the quarter ended June 30, 1997.</p>
